-- 1.2.0_HighLevelMonsterRetune.sql
--
-- Retune of the generic (non-boss) monsters in Hell Garden, Tiffauges, Ruper Island and Dracula Castle so
-- that a character of the level the content is meant for can actually fight them. Bosses are untouched.
--
-- Why. Every one of these monsters shipped with a huge TOHIT enhance (+80..+120%) on top of a level-200+
-- ToHit base, so their ToHit sits at ~1000 while a level-150..240 character's Defense is 150..480. The hit
-- roll is 50 + (ToHit - Defense)/3, clamped to 5..95 (HitRoll.cpp:154), so every one of them hit 95% of
-- the time regardless of the player's DEX or gear - evasion was doing nothing. The Hell Garden waves also
-- carry (HP,400) and (DECREASEDAMAGE,35): a level-150 character needed 60-330 melee hits per monster.
--
-- Model. Each area gets a reference character: the level the content is gated at, 3 attribute points per
-- level split STR/DEX (Horus rank ~340/340 at 150, +2 per level to 200, +2.5 after), no gear, fighting
-- at night (vampire Defense x1.5, monster ToHit and damage x1.0 - the hardest case; by day monster ToHit
-- and damage are halved, so a slayer at dusk sees about the same numbers). Targets per generic monster:
--
--     ToHit          reference night Defense + 60  -> hits the reference character ~70% of the time
--     damage         ~4.5% of the reference character's HP per landed hit, after Protection
--     HP             ~35 reference melee hits (skills kill faster)
--     DECREASEDAMAGE 15 (was 25-50)
--
-- "mid" monsters (Tiffauges 2F Gomory/Krsnik, the five Hell Garden key monsters) use +75 / 6% / 60 hits / 25.
-- The retune is nerf-only: no monster gains HP, ToHit or damage over what it has today (Ruper and Dracula
-- trash keep their HP and damage and only lose the ToHit enhance and half their DECREASEDAMAGE).
-- Reference levels: Tiffauges 1F 130, Hell Garden 1F 150 / 2F 170 / 3F 190 / 4F 210 (keys 150..230),
-- Ruper Island 185, Dracula Castle 240.
--
-- Untouched: Hell Garden 5F (all bosses) and the floor bosses / minibosses 872 873 876 878 879 880 881 890 891
-- 892, the odd [14]/Chief wave rows 824 825 836-841 845 850 (already weak), Tiffauges bosses 1037 Gusion,
-- 1040 Morgoth, 1044/1045 clones, Ruper's Gentis dungeon, and 1196 Vlad II Dracul.
-- Only the Enhance column changes; DEFENSE/PROTECTION/NEXTRATIO entries are carried over verbatim.
-- (Note: the parser only knows DEFENSE - the "(DEFENCE,-60)" spelled on 917-921 has never done anything.)
--
-- Every UPDATE is guarded on the current or the new string, so the file is safe to run twice, and the
-- "was" comment above each one is the rollback value.
--
-- Ships with gameserver code (AbilityBalance.h): the player MaxHP cap goes from 10000 to 60000 for all
-- three races. MonsterInfo is loaded once at boot, so the gameserver must be restarted after this runs.
--
-- Generated by scratchpad gen.py (reference model + formulas from AbilityBalance.cpp / HitRoll.cpp /
-- SkillUtil.cpp::computeFinalDamage) on 2026-09-25.

SET NAMES utf8mb4;

